# Licensing for The First Wall Ledger (Wall 01)

This repository is dual-licensed to guarantee that the public historical census remains open, immutable, and accessible to all autonomous agents and humans, while protecting the verification software and standards.

---

## 1. Census Data & Block Inscriptions: CC0 1.0 Universal

All historical attestation dossiers, records, schemas, and visual block artifacts located in the `ledger/` directory are dedicated to the public domain under the Creative Commons Zero (CC0 1.0 Universal) Public Domain Dedication.

To the extent possible under law, the authors and contributors have waived all copyright and related or neighboring rights to the census records. You can copy, modify, distribute, and perform the work, even for commercial purposes, all without asking permission.

For the full legal text, see: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

